# Claude Code sessions that should always be running in tmux, for
# `bin/claude-sessions` (run at login by a LaunchAgent, or by hand).
#
#   machine | tmux session | folder | conversation to resume
#
# machine       only that machine starts the line; the others ignore it
# tmux session  the name you go into it by: `sys tmux frame` on the machine,
#               or `ssh mini tmux frame` from another
# folder        where claude runs
# conversation  the title of the conversation to resume, as /rename set it.
#               Leave it empty to resume whichever was used last in the folder.
#
# A session that is already there is left alone, so running it twice is safe.

dwkns-mini | frame        | ~/Developer/Frame        | Frame - Main
dwkns-mini | lifts        | ~/Developer/lifts        | Lifts - Main
dwkns-mini | youpods      | ~/Developer/youpods      | YouPods - Main
dwkns-mini | screenviewer | ~/Developer/ScreenViewer | ScreenViewer - Main
dwkns-mini | sys          | ~/.sys                   | sys - Main
dwkns-mini | millhouse    | ~/Developer/mill-house   | Mill House - Main
